line	<col=000080>During the conversation with the crab, name the <col=800000>instrument</col> and show the crab how to play it. The Crab will then tell you to find the other ceremonial leaders by investigating trees and bushes.</col>
step	8	-	Quick guide step 8
line	<str>Drink from the bottle on the beach of Dognose Island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Crab on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect all 9 shells on the island and give them to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the big fishing net on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish the flotsam on the edge of the beach to get a sea-soaked bowstring, battered barrel, and weathered rosewood plank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the weathered rosewood plank on the sea-soaked bowstring to make instrument. Give the instrument to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>During the conversation with the crab, name the instrument and show the crab how to play it. The Crab will then tell you to find the other ceremonial leaders by investigating trees and bushes.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>On the island, investigate all the trees and bushes. If the Crab is too scared to come out, perform the <col=800000>Sit down</col> emote and wait a short period of time for them to come out. Speak to each Crab after they come out.</col>
step	9	-	Quick guide step 9
line	<str>Drink from the bottle on the beach of Dognose Island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Crab on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect all 9 shells on the island and give them to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the big fishing net on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish the flotsam on the edge of the beach to get a sea-soaked bowstring, battered barrel, and weathered rosewood plank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the weathered rosewood plank on the sea-soaked bowstring to make instrument. Give the instrument to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>During the conversation with the crab, name the instrument and show the crab how to play it. The Crab will then tell you to find the other ceremonial leaders by investigating trees and bushes.</str>
line	
line	<str>On the island, investigate all the trees and bushes. If the Crab is too scared to come out, perform the Sit down emote and wait a short period of time for them to come out. Speak to each Crab after they come out.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>For the crab who quizzes you on the ceremony after popping out of his tree, the answers are 2, 3, 1, 4.</col>
step	10	-	Quick guide step 10
line	<str>Drink from the bottle on the beach of Dognose Island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Crab on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect all 9 shells on the island and give them to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the big fishing net on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish the flotsam on the edge of the beach to get a sea-soaked bowstring, battered barrel, and weathered rosewood plank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the weathered rosewood plank on the sea-soaked bowstring to make instrument. Give the instrument to the crab.</str>
line	
line	<str>During the conversation with the crab, name the instrument and show the crab how to play it. The Crab will then tell you to find the other ceremonial leaders by investigating trees and bushes.</str>
line	
line	<str>On the island, investigate all the trees and bushes. If the Crab is too scared to come out, perform the Sit down emote and wait a short period of time for them to come out. Speak to each Crab after they come out.</str>
line	
line	<str>For the crab who quizzes you on the ceremony after popping out of his tree, the answers are 2, 3, 1, 4.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Once you have investigated all the trees and plants, return to the Crab on the beach with the <col=800000>instrument</col> and choose the option to wait for the others leads to turn up.</col>
